# pass-13a foundation reference fixture: unit cube split into 5 tetrahedra
# 5 cells, 4 nodes per tet, 0 attributes per cell
# Standard "5-tet cube" decomposition (Liu & Joe 1995): four corner
# tets plus one central tet that shares a face with each of the four.
5  4  0
1  1  2  3  6
2  1  3  4  8
3  1  6  5  8
4  3  6  7  8
5  1  3  6  8
